  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Persistent animation that doesn't require me holding a button in an action menu is one of the big ways animators can display their amazing music-synced creations.  It was also a useful way to \"lock\" animations and props to gestures.  \nThe current Action menu feels redundant (emojis when there's an emoji button) and cramped.\nThe only neat thing I noted so far was avatar customization via color changes or size variations.",
